4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_80f4c86643e5d253eba9:revision:4","quote":"安全性随访期（末次给药后28天）","quote_sha256":"19473caec3ae0b985725972d232be99949f70a341b7f0097060c00a9cb449380","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_80f4c86643e5d253eba9:r4:4306105ca993f8d1","span_id":"es5"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_80f4c86643e5d253eba9:revision:4","quote":"不良事件（AE）与严重不良事件（SAE）发生率（至末次给药后28天）；生命体征、12导联心电图、临床实验室检查异常发生率；症状性低血压发生率","quote_sha256":"eeb150d5b4105ba3f52e8fcb897d472c81b951c8a8aeebfbd7c19078cac79329","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_80f4c86643e5d253eba9:r4:4306105ca993f8d1","span_id":"es6"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_80f4c86643e5d253eba9:revision:4","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（中心实验室定量）。","quote_sha256":"cf93d08c04b1ed185004699e412fd4e8e81365a7a5b69ad855a2d977c17a8461","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_80f4c86643e5d253eba9:r4:4306105ca993f8d1","span_id":"es7"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_80f4c86643e5d253eba9:revision:4","quote":"估计目标：12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化；人群为随机化全分析集；伴发事件按治疗方针策略处理；汇总统计量为各组均值差。","quote_sha256":"625ff33f440364fc20fc6f8a2053c62306031f65cc31d16a0678ae00fe8ee8f5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_80f4c86643e5d253eba9:r4:4306105ca993f8d1","span_id":"es8"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_80f4c86643e5d253eba9:revision:4","quote":"探索性样本量：按NT-proBNP对数尺度组间SD约0.35估计，每组约40例（共160例）可在双侧α=0.10下提供约80%把握检测组间差异；含约10%脱落补偿。","quote_sha256":"4e57069650460e364624e7cac439e599febcd7fbc3b45f509feb6db8a6b15357","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_80f4c86643e5d253eba9:r4:4306105ca993f8d1","span_id":"es9"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es4","es5","es6","es7","es8","es9"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认ANCOVA模型是否纳入除基线log NT-proBNP外的其他协变量","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_9_01","missing_source_classes":["本项目统计分析计划（SAP）"],"target":"9节ANCOVA模型细节"},{"action":"确认是否进行多重比较校正、校正方法、亚组分析范围及敏感性分析方案","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_9_02","missing_source_classes":["本项目统计分析计划（SAP）"],"target":"9节多重比较与亚组分析"},{"action":"确认主要终点缺失数据的处理方法","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_9_03","missing_source_classes":["本项目统计分析计划（SAP）"],"target":"9节缺失数据处理"}],"heading":"统计分析","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，不设确证性假设检验。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），即所有随机化受试者。主要终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（中心实验室定量），采用协方差分析（ANCOVA）模型，以基线log NT-proBNP为协变量，比较SGC-R1L4低剂量组、中剂量组、高剂量组与安慰剂对照组第12周的变化，报告几何均值比及其90%置信区间。估计目标为12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化，人群为随机化全分析集，伴发事件按治疗方针策略处理，汇总统计量为各组均值差。样本量依据NT-proBNP对数尺度组间标准差约0.35估计，每组约40例（共160例），含约10%脱落补偿，在双侧α=0.10下提供约80%把握检测组间差异。安全性分析按安全性分析集（SAS）进行描述性统计，安全性终点包括不良事件与严重不良事件发生率（至末次给药后28天）、生命体征、12导联心电图、临床实验室检查异常发生率及症状性低血压发生率。","rationale":"统计分析策略、主要终点、估计目标、样本量及安全性终点均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。ANCOVA模型中除基线log NT-proBNP外的其他协变量、多重比较校正策略、亚组分析范围、缺失数据处理方法及敏感性分析方案尚未明确，需医学统计团队确认。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（统计分析）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、估计目标、伴发事件、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3c61abb51f33_f272c383ed9ab7f4","section_number":"9","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:e99b12667e6983859bb585eb","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_80f4c86643e5d253eba9:r4:4306105ca993f8d1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9691f7c94f6c58","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9895ed0bd2ffd4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"5db2a653fed7eb7e62379642df0ea248b0ba715c85b1ecc78a043a820cfe119f","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_3c61abb51f33_dd77459de84ed38c:full-draft:e99b12667e6983859bb585eb","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_se